OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1791485298
OL,3,CVerstappen navigates start chaos to
OL,4,Ctriumph in Bahrain Grand Prix
OL,6,FMax Verstappen took his first win of
OL,7,Fthe year, but a retirement for George
OL,8,FRussell handed a huge title boost to
OL,9,FKimi Antonelli at Formula 1's Bahrain
OL,10,FGrand Prix in Malaysia on Sunday.
OL,12,FVerstappen was leading, with Antonelli
OL,13,Fand Russell behind the safety car with
OL,14,Ffive laps to go, when Russell suddenly
OL,15,Fpulled over in his Mercedes. That
OL,16,Fmeans Antonelli further stretches his
OL,17,Fbig standings lead over his teammate
OL,18,FRussell.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
