PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1791485298
OL,3,CVerstappen navigates start chaos to
OL,4,Ctriumph in Bahrain Grand Prix
OL,6,FTwo laps followed behind the safety
OL,7,Fcar before a standing start.
OL,8,FVerstappen slipped to third but
OL,9,Fcleared Antonelli after another safety
OL,10,Fcar period on the 13th lap and took
OL,11,Fthe chequered flag 2.3 seconds clear
OL,12,Fof the championship leader.
OL,14,FRussell's failure to finish leaves him
OL,15,F84 points behind Antonelli with only
OL,16,Fseven scheduled races, and a possible
OL,17,F183 points remaining.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/5
