OL,3,CVerstappen navigates start chaos to
OL,4,Ctriumph in Bahrain Grand Prix
OL,6,FThe race was relocated because of the
OL,7,FIran war, becoming F1's first event at
OL,8,Fthe Sepang circuit in Malaysia since
OL,9,F2017.
